# The theme directory is implicitly imported by every qml file in it, and Qt
# reads this qmldir when it does - which is what makes the singleton below
# resolvable as a bare `Palette.brass` from any component here, with no import
# statement and no import path fiddling.
#
# Everything else in the directory resolves implicitly by filename and does not
# need a line here. Only the singleton does.
singleton Palette 1.0 Palette.qml
